  california and we need to stick together  we can all be thankful to be americans  there's nowhere in the world i'd rather  be that's for sure but even as we take a  moment to appreciate our great good  fortune to be americans  we need to recognize that america is not  just the physical place we inhabit with  all its beauty and majesty it's the idea  we were built on the idea of liberty  under the law the idea of  self-government expressed in so many  different aspects of the constitution  the most important and magnificent  political document ever written let's be  honest it's all under assault today  from an arrogant and elitist ruling  establishment from a rampant reckless  democratic party captured by the far  left  perhaps most perniciously from the  un-american authoritarianism of wokism  so when they try to take away our  freedom with spurious claims about  protecting public health and bogus  pseudo-scientific claptrap we must say  that is anti-american and we're not  going to stand for it  when they try to subvert the  constitution the idea of decentralized  power captured in the 10th amendment  with their insane build back better  legislation that aims to centralize  power in the federal government and its  bureaucracy we have to say that is  anti-american we won't let you do it  and when they try to extinguish the  beating heart of american  dynamism and exceptionalism the  foundational principle that no one can  tell you what to say or think that  everyone has the right to follow their  own path free from censorship or  coercion  we have a duty to tell the woke  authoritarianism your fascism is  anti-american it is not welcome here we  will fight you and defeat you just as we  defeated fascism before  so yes as americans we have a lot to be  thankful for  but with that comes a responsibility to  stand up for the very things that make  this country so great in the first place  hey sean hannity here hey click here to  subscribe to fox news youtube page and